# #2392: writer projections now validate the optional incremental-history header.
# Existing clients omit it; malformed supplied hints intentionally receive 400.
# Remove both entries once main contains this request contract.
GET /containers/{containerId}/writer-projection: request refinement 'request.projection-history-prefixes' was added; existing clients were not rejected by it.
GET /documents/{documentId}/writer-projection: request refinement 'request.projection-history-prefixes' was added; existing clients were not rejected by it.
